<span id="A5.F10.pic1.p1.pic1.2.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.F10.pic1.p1.pic1.2.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-bg-color:#FFFFB3;">&lt;search&gt;</span></span>
