<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 8: </span>Detailed ablation study on path reward components (ACC %). Removing reference-alignment causes larger drops on multi-hop datasets where external guidance is more critical, while removing self-consistency affects general QA more where the model’s own planning suffices.</figcaption>
</figure>
